{
  "id": "RLSA-2026:84721",
  "title": "Important: wireshark security update",
  "issued": {
    "date": "2026-10-20 12:10:14"
  },
  "updated": {
    "date": "2026-10-23 06:53:27"
  },
  "severity": "Important",
  "description": "The wireshark packages contain a network protocol analyzer used to capture and browse the traffic running on a computer network.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* wireshark: Wireshark: Denial of Service via C12.22 protocol dissector crash (CVE-2026-76886)\n\n* wireshark: Wireshark: Denial of Service via RRC protocol dissector out-of-bounds write (CVE-2026-76880)\n\n* wireshark: Wireshark: Denial of Service vulnerability in ESS protocol dissector (CVE-2026-76919)\n\n* wireshark: Wireshark: Denial of Service via C12.22 protocol dissector crash (CVE-2026-76879)\n\n* wireshark: Wireshark: Denial of Service via X.509IF protocol dissector crash (CVE-2026-76928)\n\n* wireshark: Wireshark: Denial of Service vulnerability in H.245 protocol dissector (CVE-2026-76927)\n\n* wireshark: wireshark: Denial of Service via heap-based buffer overflow in SPDY dissector (CVE-2026-95387)\n\n* wireshark: Heap-based Buffer Overflow in Wireshark (CVE-2026-95389)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
